Apple is offering 10% off AirPods, Beats, or accessories to customers who recycle an eligible iPhone, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad/">iPad</a>, Apple Watch, or Mac at a participating <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-store/">Apple Store</a> through May 16.<br/>
<br/>
